{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Imam Muhammad al-Jawad (a.s.) — Kazimayn",
  "data": "First Ziyarah\nRecitation at the entrance /Izn Dukhool\nاللَّهُ اكْبَرُ ٱللَّهُ اكْبَرُ\nALLAAHO AKBARUL LAAHO AKBARO\nAllah is the Most Great. Allah is the Most Great.\nلاََ إِِلٰهَ إِِلاَّ ٱللَّهُ وَٱللَّهُ اكْبَرُ\nLAA ELAAHA ILLAL LAAHO WAL LAAHO AKBARO\nThere is no god save Allah. And Allah is the Most Great.\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ عَلَىٰ هِدَايَتِهِ لِدِينِهِ\nALHAMDO LILLAAHE A’LAA HEDAAYATEHI LE-DEENEHI\nAll praise be to Allah for guiding [me] to His religion\nوَٱلتَّوْفِيقِ لِمَا دَعَا إِِلَيْهِ مِنْ سَبِيلِهِ\nWAT TAWFEEQE LEMAA DA-A’A ELAYHE MIN SABEELEHI\nand for leading [me] successfully to His Course to which He has invited (us).\nاَللَّهُمَّ إِِنَّكَ اكْرَمُ مَقْصُودٍ\nALLAAHUMMA INNAKA AKRAMO MAQSOODIN\nO Allah, You are verily the most Honorable Besought One\nوَاكْرَمُ مَاتِيٍّ\nWA AKRAMO MAATIYYIN\nand the most Honorable Purposed One.\nوَقَدْ اتَيْتُكَ مُتَقَرِّباً إِِلَيْكَ\nWA QAD ATAYTOKA MOTAQARREBAN ELAYKA\nI thus have come to You, seeking nearness to You\nبِٱبْنِ بِنْتِ نَبِيِّكَ\nBIBNE BINTE NABIYYEKA\nin the name of the son of Your Prophet’s daughter,\nصَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَعَلَىٰ آبَائِهِ ٱلطَّاهِرِينَ\nSALAWAATOKA A’LAYHE WA A’LAA AABAAA-EHIT TAAHEREENA\nYour blessings be upon him and upon his immaculate fathers\nوَابْنَائِهِ ٱلطَّيِّبِينَ\nWA ABNAAA-EHIT TAYYEBEENA\nand pure sons.\nاَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَلاَ تُخَيِّبْ سَعْيِي\nWA LAA TOKHAYYIB SA’YEE\nnever frustrate my efforts,\nوَلاَ تَقْطَعْ رَجَائِي\nWA LAA TAQTA’ RAJAAA-EE\nnever cut off my hope,\nوَٱجْعَلْنِي عِنْدَكَ وَجِيهاً\nWAJ A’LNEE I’NDAKA WAJEEHAN\nmake me illustrious in Your view\nفِي ٱلدُّنْيَا وَٱلآخِرَةِ وَمِنَ ٱلْمُقَرَّبِينَ\nFID DUNYAA WAL AAKHERATE WA MENAL MOQARRABEENA\nin this world as well as the world to come, and make me of those brought near to You.\nYou may then enter the shrine by preceding your right foot (to the left), saying the following words:\nبِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ وَبِٱللَّهِ\nBISMIL LAAHE WA BILLAAHE\nIn the Name of Allah (I begin), in Allah (I trust),\nوَفِي سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ\nWA FEE SABEELIL LAAHE\nand on the way of Allah\nوَعَلَىٰ مِلَّةِ رَسُولِ ٱللَّهِ\nWA A’LAA MILLATE RASOOLIL LAAHE\nand on the norm of the Messenger of Allah (I proceed),\nصَلَّىٰ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ\nSALLAL LAAHO A’LAYHE WA AALEHI\nmay Allah bless him and his Household.\nاَللَّهُمَّ ٱغْفِرْ لِي وَلِوَالِدَيَّ\nALLAAHUMMAGH FIR LEE WA LE-WAALEDAYYA\nO Allah, (please do) forgive me, my parents,\nوَلِجَمِيعِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَاتِ\nWA LE-JAMEE-I’L MOAMENEENA WAL MOAMENAATE\nand all the believing men and women.\nWhen you reach the gate of the dome, you may stop there and ask permission of entrance by saying the following words:\nاادْخُلُ يَا رَسُولَ ٱللَّهِ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA RASOOLAL LAAHE\nO Allah’s Messenger, may I enter?\nاادْخُلُ يَا نَبِيَّ ٱللَّهِ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA NABIYYAL LAAHE\nO Allah’ Prophet, may I enter?\nاادْخُلُ يَا مُحَمَّدُ بْنَ عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MOHAMMADUBNA A’BDIL LAAHE\nO Muhammad the son of `Abdullah, may I enter?\nاادْخُلُ يَا امِيرَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA AMEERAL MOAMENEENA\nO Commander of the Faithful, may I enter?\nاادْخُلُ يَا ابَا مُحَمَّدٍ ٱلْحَسَنُ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA ABAA MOHAMMADENIL HASANO\nO Abu-Muhammad al-Hasan, may I enter?\nاادْخُلُ يَا ابَا عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلْحُسَيْنُ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHIL HOSAYNO\nO Abu-`Abdullah al-Husayn, may I enter?\nاادْخُلُ يَا ابَا مُحَمَّدٍ عَلِيُّ بْنَ ٱلْحُسَيْنِ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA ABAA MOHAMMADIN A’LIYYUBNAL HOSAYNE\nO Abu-Muhammad `Ali ibn al-Husayn, may I enter?\nاادْخُلُ يَا ابَا جَعْفَرٍ مُحَمَّدُ بْنَ عَلِيٍّ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA ABAA JA’FARIM MOHAMMADUBNA A’LIYYIN\nO Abu-Ja`far Muhammad ibn `Ali, may I enter?\nاادْخُلُ يَا ابَا عَبْدِ ٱللَّهِ جَعْفَرُ بْنَ مُحَمَّدٍ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE JA’FARUBNA MOHAMMADIN\nO Abu-`Abdullah Ja`far ibn Muhammad, may I enter?\nاادْخُلُ يَا مَوْلاَيَ يَا ابَا ٱلْحَسَنِ مُوسَىٰ بْنَ جَعْفَرٍ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MAWLAAYA YAA ABAL HASANE MOOSABNA JA’FARIN\nO my master Abu’l-Hasan Musa ibn Ja`far, may I enter?\nاادْخُلُ يَا مَوْلاَيَ يَا ابَا جَعْفَرٍ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MAWLAAYA YAA ABAA JA’FARIN\nO my master Abu-Ja`far, may I enter?\nاادْخُلُ يَا مَوْلاَيَ مُحَمَّدُ بْنَ عَلِيٍّ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MAWLAAYA MOHAMMADUBNA A’LIYYIN\nO my master Muhammad ibn `Ali, may I enter?\nWhile entering, you may repeat the following statement four times:\nاَللَّهُ اكْبَرُ\nALLAAHO AKBARO\nAllah is the Most Great.\nAbout the ziyarah form dedicated to Imam Muhammad al-Jawad (peace be upon him), the three master scholars (Shaykh al-Mufid, al-Shahid, and Muhammad ibn al-Mashhadi) have said the following: You may direct yourself to the tomb of Abu-Ja`far Muhammad ibn `Ali al-Jawad (peace be upon him). When you stop near the tomb, you may say the following words:\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WALIYYAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O intimate servant of Allah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HUJJATAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s argument.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نُورَ ٱللَّهِ فِي ظُلُمَاتِ ٱلأَرْضِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA NOORAL LAAHE FEE ZOLOMAATIL ARZE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s light in the darkness of the earth.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ رَسُولِ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA RASOOLIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O son of Allah’s Messenger.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ وَعَلَىٰ آبَائِكَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA WA A’LAA AABAAA-EKA\nPeace be upon you and upon your fathers.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ وَعَلَىٰ أَبْنَائِكَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA WA A’LAA ABNAAA-EKA\nPeace be upon you and upon your descendants.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ وَعَلَىٰ أَوْلِيَائِكَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA WA A’LAA AWLEYAAA-EKA\nPeace be upon you and upon your loyalists.\nأَشْهَدُ أَنَّكَ قَدْ أَقَمْتَ ٱلصَّلاَةَ\nASH-HADO ANNAKA QAD AQAMTAS SALAATA\nI bear witness that you performed the prayers,\nوَآتَيْتَ ٱلزَّكَاةَ\nWA AATAYTAZ ZAKAATA\ndefrayed the poor-rate,\nوَأَمَرْتَ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ\nWA AMARTA BIL-MA’ROOFE\nenjoined the right,\nوَنَهَيْتَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنْكَرِ\nWA NAHAYTA A’NIL MUNKARE\nforbade the wrong,\nوَتَلَوْتَ ٱلْكِتَابَ حَقَّ تِلاَوَتِهِ\nWA TALAWTAL KETAABA HAQQA TELAAWATEHI\nrecited the Book as it should be recited,\nوَجَاهَدْتَ فِي ٱللَّهِ حَقَّ جِهَادِهِ\nWA JAAHADTA FIL LAAHE HAQQA JEHAADEHI\nstrove for Allah as exactly as striving should be,\nوَصَبَرْتَ عَلَىٰ ٱلأَذَىٰ فِي جَنْبِهِ\nWA SABARTA A’LAL AZAA FEE JANBEHI\nand endured harm for His sake\nحَتَّىٰ أَتَاكَ ٱلْيَقِينُ\nHATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEENO\nuntil death came upon you.\nأَتَيْتُكَ زَائِراً\nATAYTOKA ZAAA-ERAN\nI have come to you, visiting you,\nعَارِفاً بِحَقِّكَ\nA’AREFAN BE-HAQQEKA\nrecognizing your right,\nمُوَالِياً لأَوْلِيَائِكَ\nMOWAALEYAL LE-AWLEYAAA-EKA\ndeclaring loyalty to your loyalists,\nمُعَادِياً لأَعْدَائِكَ\nMO-A’ADEYAL LE-A-A’DAAA-EKA\nand incurring the animosity of your enemies;\nفَٱشْفَعْ لِي عِنْدَ رَبِّكَ\nFASHFA’ LEE I’NDA RABBEKA\nso, (please) intercede for me with Your Lord.\nYou may then kiss the tomb and put your both cheeks on it. You may then offer the two-unit prayer of ziyarah, after which you may offer any other prayers. You may then prostrate and say the following words:\nإِرْحَمْ مَنْ أَسَاءَ وَٱقَتَرَفَ\nIRHAM MAN ASAAA-A WAQ TARAFA\n(Please) have mercy upon him who had misbehaved and committed sins,\nوَٱسْتَكَانَ وَٱعْتَرَفَ\nWAS TAKAANA WA’TARAFA\nbut he then submitted and confessed.\nYou may then place your right cheek on the ground and say the following words:\nإِنْ كُنْتُ بِئْسَ ٱلْعَبْدُ\nIN KUNTO BEASAL A’BDO\nIf I am the worst servant (of You),\nفَأَنْتَ نِعْمَ ٱلرَّبُّ\nFA-ANTA NE’MAR RABBO\nthen You are the All-excellent Lord.\nYou may then place your left cheek on the ground and say the following words:\nعَظُمَ ٱلذَّنْبُ مِنْ عَبْدِكَ\nA’ZOMAZ ZANBO MIN A’BDEKA\nYour servant’s sin has been very flagrant,\nفَلْيَحْسُنِ ٱلْعَفْوُ مِنْ عِنْدِكَ\nFALYAHSONIL A’FWO MIN I’NDEKA\nthen let Your pardon be very excellent.\nيَا كَرِيمُ\nYAA KAREEMO\nO All-generous!\nyou may then return to the position of prostration and repeat the following word one hundred times:\nشُكْراً\nSHUKRAN\nThanks.\nIn his book of al-Mazar, Sayyid Ibn Tawus says: You may stop at the tomb of Imam al-Jawad (peace be upon him), kiss it, and say the following words:\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا أَبَا جَعْفَرٍ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA JA’FARIN\nPeace be upon you, O Abu-Ja`far\nمُحَمَّدُ بْنَ عَلِيٍّ\nMOHAMMADUBNA A’LIYYIN\nMuhammad the son of `Ali,\nٱلْبَرُّ ٱلتَّقِيُّ\nALBARRUT TAQIYYO\nthe righteous, pious,\nٱلإِمَامُ ٱلْوَفِيُّ\nAL-EMAAMUL WAFIYYO\nand faithful leader.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ أَيُّهَا ٱلرَّضِيُّ ٱلزَّكِيُّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAR RAZIYYUZ ZAKIYYO\nPeace be upon you, O pleased and pure.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WALIYYAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s intimate servant.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نَجِيَّ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA NAJIYYAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O confidentially talked by Allah.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَفِيرَ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAFEERAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s emissary.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سِرَّ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SIRRAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s secret.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ضِيَاءَ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ZEYAAA-AL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s brightness.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَنَاءَ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SANAAA-AL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s brilliance.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا كَلِمَةَ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KALEMATAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s Word.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا رَحْمَةَ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA RAHMATAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s mercy.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ أَيُّهَا ٱلنُّوُرُ ٱلسَّاطِعُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAN NOORUS SAATE-O’\nPeace be upon you, O shining light.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ أَيُّهَا ٱلْبَدْرُ ٱلطَّالِعُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL BADRUT TAALE-O’\nPeace be upon you, O rising full moon.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ أَيُّهَا ٱلطَّيِّبُ مِنَ ٱلطَّيِّبِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAT TAYYEBO MENAT TAYYEBEENA\nPeace be upon you, O pure who is the descendant of the pure ones.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ أَيُّهَا ٱلطَّاهِرُ مِنَ ٱلْمُطَهَّرِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAT TAAHERO MENAL MOTAHHAREENA\nPeace be upon you, O immaculate who is the descendant of the the immaculate ones.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ أَيُّهَا ٱلآيَةُ ٱلْعُظْمَىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL AAYATUL U’ZMAA\nPeace be upon you, O greatest sign.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ أَيُّهَا ٱلْحُجَّةُ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL HUJJATUL KUBRAA\nPeace be upon you, O grandest argument.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ أَيُّهَا ٱلْمُطَهَّرُ مِنَ ٱلزَّلاَّتِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL MOTAHHARO MENAZ ZALLAATE\nPeace be upon you, O purified from slips.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ أَيُّهَا ٱلْمُنَزَّهُ عَنِ ٱلْمُعْضِلاَتِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL MONAZZAHU A’NIL MO’ZELAATE\nPeace be upon you, O deemed above unforgivable failings.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ أَيُّهَا ٱلْعَلِيُّ عَنْ نَقْصِ ٱلأَوْصَافِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL A’LIYYO A’N NAQSIL AWSAAFE\nPeace be upon you, O raised high against imperfect traits.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ أَيُّهَا ٱلرَّضِيُّ عِنْدَ ٱلأَشْرَافِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAR RAZIYYO I’NDAL ASHRAAFE\nPeace be upon you, O pleased in the sight of the honorable ones.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَمُودَ ٱلدِّينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA A’MOODAD DEENE\nPeace be upon you, O pillar of the religion.\nأَشْهَدُ أَنَّكَ وَلِيُّ ٱللَّهِ\nASH-HADO ANNAKA WALIYYUL LAAHE\nI bear witness that you are the intimate servant of Allah,\nوَحُجَّتُهُ فِي أَرْضِهِ\nWA HUJJATOHU FEE ARZEHI\nthe argument of Him in His lands,\nوَأَنَّكَ جَنْبُ ٱللَّهِ وَخِيَرَةُ ٱللَّهِ\nWA ANNAKA JANBUL LAAHE WA KHEYARATUL LAAHE\nthe side of Allah, the best in the view of Allah,\nوَمُسْتَوْدَعُ عِلْمِ ٱللَّهِ وَعِلْمِ ٱلأَنْبِيَاءِ\nWA MUSTAWDA-O’ I’LMIL LAAHE WA I’LMIL ANBEYAAA-E\nthe store of the knowledge of Allah and the knowledge of the Prophets,\nوَرُكْنُ ٱلإِيمَانِ وَتَرْجُمَانُ ٱلْقُرْآنِ\nWA RUKNUL EEMAANE WA TARJOMAANUL QUR-AANE\nthe cornerstone of faith, and the interpreter of the Qur'an.\nوَأَشْهَدُ أَنَّ مَنِ ٱتَّبَعَكَ عَلَىٰ ٱلْحَقِّ وَٱلْهُدَىٰ\nWA ASH-HADO ANNA MANIT TABA-A’KA A’LAL HAQQE WAL HODAA\nI also bear witness that whoever follows you has been on the right and true guidance\nوَأَنَّ مَنْ أَنْكَرَكَ وَنَصَبَ لَكَ ٱلْعَدَاوَةَ\nWA ANNA MAN ANKARAKA WA NASABA LAKAL A’DAAWATA\nbut whoever denies you and incurs your animosity\nعَلَىٰ ٱلضَّلاَلَةِ وَٱلرَّدَىٰ\nA’LAZ ZALAALATE WAR RADAA\nhas been on deviation and perdition.\nأَبْرَأُ إِلَىٰ ٱللَّهِ وَإِلَيْكَ مِنْهُمْ فِي ٱلدُّنْيَا وَٱلآخِرَةِ\nABRA-O ELAL LAAHE WA ELAYKA MINHUM FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHERATE\nI repudiate these in the presence of Allah and you in this world and in the Hereafter.\nوَٱلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ مَا بَقِيتُ وَبَقِيَ ٱللَّيْلُ وَٱلنَّهَارُ\nWAS SALAAMO A’LAYKA MAA BAQEETO WA BAQEYAL LAYLO WAN NAHAARO\nPeace be upon you as long as I am existent and as long as there are day and night.\nThen recite this salawaat (invocation of blessings) upon Imam Mohammed Taqi Jawad (peace be upon him)\nاَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَأَهْلِ بَيْتِهِ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AHLE BAYTEHI\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Muhammad and his Household,\nوَصَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ\nWA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIBNE A’LIYYIN\nsend blessings upon Muhammad the son of `Ali,\nٱلزَّكِيِّ ٱلتَّقِيِّ\nAZZAKIYYIT TAQIYYE\nthe pure, the pious,\nوَٱلْبَرِّ ٱلْوَفِيِّ\nWAL BARRIL WAFIYYE\nthe righteous, the faithful,\nوَٱلْمُهَذَّبِ ٱلنَّقِيِّ\nWAL MOHAZZABIN NAQIYYE\nthe refined, the bright,\nهَادِي ٱلأُمَّةِ\nHAADIL UMMATE\nthe guide of the nation,\nوَوَارِثِ ٱلأَئِمَّةِ\nWA WAARESIL A-IMMATE\nthe inheritor of the Imams,\nوَخَازِنِ ٱلرَّحْمَةِ\nWA KHAAZENIR RAHMATE\nthe hoarder of mercy,\nوَيَنْبُوعِ ٱلْحِكْمَةِ\nWA YANBOO-I’L HIKMATE\nthe spring of wisdom,\nوَقَائِدِ ٱلْبَرَكَةِ\nWA QAAA-EDIL BARAKATE\nthe leader of blessing,\nوَعَدِيلِ ٱلْقُرْآنِ فِي ٱلطَّاعَةِ\nWA A’DEELIL QUR-AANE FIT TAA-A’TE\nthe match of the Qur'an in obedience,\nوَوَاحِدِ ٱلأَوْصِيَاءِ فِي ٱلإِخْلاَصِ وَٱلْعِبَادَةِ\nWA WAAHEDIL AWSEYAAA-E FIL IKHLAASE WAL E’BAADATE\nthe distinctive among the Successors in sincerity and worship,\nوَحُجَّتِكَ ٱلْعُلْيَا\nWA HUJJATEKAL U’LYAA\nYour premier argument,\nوَمَثَلِكَ ٱلأَعْلَىٰ\nWA MASALEKAL A-A’LAA\nYour highest example,\nوَكَلِمَتِكَ ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ\nWA KALEMATEKAL HUSNAA\nYour most excellent Word,\nٱلدَّاعِي إِلَيْكَ\nADDAA-E’E ELAYKA\nthe caller to You,\nوَٱلدَّالِّ عَلَيْكَ\nWAD DAALLE A’LAYKA\nand the director towards You,\nٱلَّذِي نَصَبْتَهُ عَلَماً لِعِبَادِكَ\nALLAZEE NASABTAHU A’LAMAL LE-E’BAADEKA\nwhom You have appointed as signpost for Your servants,\nوَمُتَرْجِماً لِكِتَابِكَ\nWA MOTARJEMAL LE-KETAABEKA\ninterpreter of Your Book,\nوَصَادِعاً بِأَمْرِكَ\nWA SAADE-A’N BE-AMREKA\nexpounder of Your commands,\nوَنَاصِراً لِدِينِكَ\nWA NAASERAL LE-DEENEKA\nsupporter of Your religion,\nوَحُجَّةً عَلَىٰ خَلْقِكَ\nWA HUJJATAN A’LAA KHALQEKA\nargument against Your creatures,\nوَنُوراً تَخْرُقُ بِهِ ٱلظُّلَمَ\nWA NOORAN TAKHROQO BEHIZ ZOLAMA\nradiance through whom darkness is penetrated,\nوَقُدْوَةً تُدْرَكُ بِهَا ٱلْهِدَايَةُ\nWA QUDWATAN TUDRAKO BEHAL HEDAAYATO\nexcellent example through whom true guidance is hit,\nوَشَفيعاً تُنَالُ بِهِ ٱلْجَنَّةُ\nWA SHAFEE-A’N TONAALO BEHIL JANNATO\nand intercessor through whom Paradise is won.\nاَللَّهُمَّ وَكَمَا أَخَذَ فِي خُشُوعِهِ لَكَ حَظَّهُ\nALLAAHUMMA WA KAMAA AKHAZA FEE KHOSHOO-E’HI LAKA HAZZAHU\nO Allah, just as he took his share of reverence for You\nوَٱسْتَوْفَىٰ مِنْ خَشْيَتِكَ نَصِيبَهُ\nWAS TAWFAA MIN KHASHYATEKA NASEEBAHU\nand received completely his portion of fear of You,\nفَصَلِّ عَلَيْهِ أَضْعَافَ مَا صَلَّيْتَ عَلَىٰ وَلِيٍّ\nFASALLE A’LAYHE AZ-A’AFA MAA SALLAYTA A’LAA WALIYYIN\nso (please) bless him with many folds of blessings that You have ever poured down on an intimate servant of You\nٱرْتَضَيْتَ طَاعَتَهُ\nIRTAZAYTA TAA-A’TAHU\nwhose obedience to You has been approved of by You\nوَقَبِلْتَ خِدْمَتَهُ\nWA QABILTA KHIDMATAHU\nand whose servitude has been admitted by You.\nوَبَلِّغْهُ مِنَّا تَحِيَّةً وَسَلاَماً\nWA BALLIGH-HO MINNAA TAHIYYATANW WA SALAAMAN\nConvey to him greetings and salutations from us,\nوَآتِنَا فِي مُوَالاَتِهِ مِنْ لَدُنْكَ فَضْلًا وَإِحْسَاناً\nWA AATENAA FEE MOWAALAATEHI MIL LADUNKA FAZLANW WA EHSAANAN\nand give us - from You on account of our loyalty to him - favors, kindness,\nوَمَغْفِرَةً وَرِضْوَاناً\nWA MAGHFERATANW WA RIZWAANAN\nforgiveness, and pleasure.\nإِنَّكَ ذُو ٱلْمَنِّ ٱلْقَدِيمِ\nINNAKA ZUL MANNIL QADEEME\nYou are verily the Lord of eternal favoring\nوَٱلصَّفْحِ ٱلْجَمِيلِ\nWAS SAFHIL JAMEELE\nand nice pardoning.\nYou may then offer the two-unit prayer of ziyarah and say the supplication, which begins with this statement:\nاَللَّهُمَّ انْتَ ٱلرَّبُّ وَانَا ٱلْمَرْبُوبُ…\nALLAAHUMMA ANTAR RABBO WA ANAL MARBOOBO\nO Allah, You are the Sustainer and I am the sustained…\nIn Man-la Yadhahrul Faqih, Shaykh al-Saduq has reported the following: When you intend to visit Imam al-Jawad (peace be upon him), you may bathe yourself and put on two clean (and ceremonially pure) pieces of clothes. You may then say the following words:\nَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIBNE A’LIYYIN\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Muhammad the son of `Ali,\nٱلإِمَامِ ٱلتَّقِيِّ ٱلنَّقِيِّ\nAL-EMAAMIT TAQIYYIN NAQIYYE\nthe pious, bright,\nٱلرِّضِيِّ ٱلْمَرْضِيِّ\nARRAZIYYIL MARZIYYE\npleasing, and pleased Imam\nوَحُجَّتِكَ عَلَىٰ مَنْ فَوْقَ ٱلأَرْضِ\nWA HUJJATEKA A’LAA MAN FAWQAL ARZE\nand Your argument against all those who are on the earth\nوَمَنْ تَحْتَ ٱلثَّرَىٰ\nWA MAN TAHTAS SARAA\nand those who are beneath the ground\nصَلاَةً كَثِيرَةً\nSALAATAN KASEERATAN\nwith such blessings that are plentiful,\nنَامِيَةً زَاكِيَةً مُبَارَكَةً\nNAAMEYATAN ZAAKEYATAM MOBAARAKATAN\never-increasing, pure, blessed,\nمُتَوَاصِلَةً مُتَرَادِفَةً مُتَوَاتِرَةً\nMOTAWAASELATAM MOTARAADEFATAM MOTAWAATERATAN\ncontinuous, consecutive, and uninterrupted\nكَأَفْضَلِ مَا صَلَّيْتَ عَلَىٰ أَحَدٍ مِنْ أَوْلِيَائِكَ\nKA-AFZALE MAA SALLAYTA A’LAA AHADIM MIN AWLEYAAA-EKA\nand with the most excellent blessings that You have ever conferred upon any of Your intimate servants.\nوَٱلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ ٱللَّهِ\nWAS SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WALIYYAL LAAHE\nAnd peace be upon you, O Allah’s most intimate servant.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نُورَ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA NOORAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s brightness.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ ٱللَّهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HUJJATAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s argument.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا إِمَامَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA EMAAMAL MOAMENEENA\nPeace be upon you, O leader of the believers,\nوَوَارِثَ عِلْمِ ٱلنَّبِيِّينَ\nWA WAARESA I’LMIN NABIYYEENA\ninheritor of the knowledge of the Prophets,\nوَسُلاَلَةَ ٱلْوَصِيِّينَ\nWA SOLAALATAL WASIYYEENA\nand descendant of the Prophets’ successors.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نُورَ ٱللَّهِ فِي ظُلُمَاتِ ٱلأَرْضِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA NOORAL LAAHE FEE ZOLOMAATIL ARZE\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s light in the darkness of the earth.\nأَتَيْتُكَ زَائِراً\nATAYTOKA ZAAA-ERAN\nI have come to you, visiting you,\nعَارِفاً بِحَقِّكَ\nA’AREFAN BE-HAQQEKA\nrecognizing your right,\nمُعَادِياً لأَعْدَائِكَ\nMO-A’ADEYAL LE-A-A’DAAA-EKA\nincurring the animosity of your enemies,\nمُوَالِياً لأَوْلِيَائِكَ\nMOWAALEYAL LE-AWLEYAAA-EKA\nand showing loyalty to your loyalists.\nفَٱشْفَعْ لِي عِنْدَ رَبِّكَ\nFASHFA’ LEE I’NDA RABBEKA\nSo, (please) intercede for me with your Lord.\nYou may then pray to Almighty Allah to grant you your personal needs.",
