    "Ziyarat from Baqiyat al-Salihat\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَىٰ ٱلْبَابِ ٱلأَقْصَدِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAL BAABIL AQSADE\nPeace be upon the most straight door (to true guidance),\nوَٱلطَّرِيقِ ٱلأَرْشَدِ\nWAT TAREEQIL ARSHADE\nthe most upright path,\nوَٱلْعَالِمِ ٱلْمُؤَيَّدِ\nWAL A’ALEMIL MO-AYYADE\nthe Divinely supported knower,\nيُنْبُوعِ ٱلْحِكَمِ\nYUNBOO-I’L HEKAME\nthe spring of wisdoms,\nوَمِصْبَاحِ ٱلظُّلَمِ\nWA MISBAAHIZ ZOLAME\nthe lantern in darkness,\nسَيِّدِ ٱلْعَرَبِ وَٱلْعَجَمِ\nSAYYEDIL A’RABE WAL A’JAME\nthe chief of Arabs and non-Arabs,\nٱلْهَادِي إِلَىٰ ٱلرَّشَادِ\nALHAADEE ELAR RASHAADE\nthe guide to orthodoxy,\nٱلْمُوَفَّقِ بِٱلتَّأْيِيدِ وَٱلسَّدَادِ\nALMOWAFFAQE BIT-TAAYEEDE WAS SADAADE\nand the granted success by means of support and leading to trueness;\nمَوْلاَيَ أَبِي جَعْفَرٍ\nMAWLAAYA ABEE JA’FARIN\nmy master Abu-Ja`far\nمُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ ٱلْجَوَادِ\nMOHAMMADIBNE A’LIYYINIL JAWAADE\nMuhammad the son of `Ali the Magnanimous.\nأَشْهَدُ يَا وَلِيَّ ٱللَّهِ\nASH-HADO YAA WALIYYAL LAAHE\nI bear witness that you are the intimate servant of Allah;\nأَنَّكَ أَقَمْتَ ٱلصَّلاَةَ\nANNAKA AQAMTAS SALAATA\nyou performed the prayers,\nوَآتَيْتَ ٱلزَّكَاةَ\nWA AATAYTAZ ZAKAATA\ndefrayed the poor-rate,\nوَأَمَرْتَ بِٱلْمَعْرُوفِ\nWA AMARTA BIL-MA’ROOFE\nenjoined the right,\nوَنَهَيْتَ عَنِ ٱلْمُنْكَرِ\nWA NAHAYTA A’NIL MUNKARE\nforbade the wrong,\nوَجَاهَدْتَ فِي سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ حَقَّ جِهَادِهِ\nWA JAAHADTA FEE SABEELIL LAAHE HAQQA JEHAADEHI\nstrove in the way of Allah as exactly as strife should be,\nوَعَبَدْتَ ٱللَّهَ مُخْلِصاً حَتَّىٰ أَتَاكَ ٱلْيَقِينُ\nWA A’BADTAL LAAHA MUKHLESAN HATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEENO\nand served Allah sincerely until death came upon you.\nفَعِشْتَ سَعِيداً\nFA-I’SHTA SA-E’EDAN\nSo, you lived happily\nوَمَضَيْتَ شَهَِيداً\nWA MAZAYTA SHAHEEDAN\nand passed away as martyr.\nيَا لَيْتَنِي كُنْتُ مَعَكُمْ\nYAA LAYTANEE KUNTO MA-A’KUM\nWould that I were with you,\nفَأَفُوزَ فَوْزاً عَظِيماً\nFA-AFOOZA FAWZAN A’ZEEMAN\nthen should I achieve a great success.\nوَرَحْمَةُ ٱللَّهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ\nWA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nAllah’s mercy and blessings be upon you.\nYou may then kiss the blessed soil (of the tomb) and place your right cheek on it.\nYou may then offer the two-unit prayer of ziyarah after which you may pray Almighty Allah for any thing you want.",
    "Dua After Ziyarat\nاَللَّهُمَّ أَنْتَ ٱلرَّبُّ وَأَنَا ٱلْمَرْبُوبُ\nALLAAHUMMA ANTAR RABBO WA ANAL MARBOOBO\nO Allah, You are the Sustainer and I am the sustained.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْخَالِقُ وَأَنَا ٱلْمَخْلُوقُ\nWA ANTAL KHAALEQO WA ANAL MAKHLOOQO\nYou are the Creator and I am the created.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْمَالِكُ وَأَنَا ٱلْمَمْلُوكُ\nWA ANTAL MAALEKO WA ANAL MAMLOOKO\nYou are the Owner and I am the owned.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْمُعْطِي وَأَنَا ٱلسَّائِلُ\nWA ANTAL MO’TEE WA ANAS SAAA-ELO\nYou are the Granter and I am the beggar.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلرَّازِقُ وَأَنَا ٱلْمَرْزُوقُ\nWA ANTAR RAAZEQO WA ANAL MARZOOQO\nYou are the Provider with sustenance and I am the receiver of sustenance.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْقَادِرُ وَأَنَا ٱلْعَاجِزُ\nWA ANTAL QAADERO WA ANAL A’AJEZO\nYou are the All-powerful and I am the powerless.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْقَوِيُّ وَأَنَا ٱلضَّعِيفُ\nWA ANTAL QAWIYYO WA ANAZ ZA-E’EFO\nYou are the All-forceful and I am the weak.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْمُغِيثُ وَأَنَا ٱلْمُسْتَغِيثُ\nWA ANTAL MOGHEESO WA ANAL MUSTAGHEESO\nYou are the Aide and I am the seeker of aid.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلدَّائِمُ وَأَنَا ٱلزَّائِلُ\nWA ANTAD DAAA-EMO WA ANAZ ZAAA-ELO\nYou are the Everlasting and I am destined to die.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْكَبِيرُ وَأَنَا ٱلْحَقِيرُ\nWA ANTAL KABEERO WA ANAL HAQEERO\nYou are the Significant and I am the trivial.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْعَظِيمُ وَأَنَا ٱلصَّغِيرُ\nWA ANTAL A’ZEEMO WA ANAS SAGHEERO\nYou are the Great and I am the tiny.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْمَوْلَىٰ وَأَنَا ٱلْعَبْدُ\nWA ANTAL MAWLAA WA ANAL A’BDO\nYou are the Lord and I am the slave.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ وَأَنَا ٱلذَّلِيلُ\nWA ANTAL A’ZEEZO WA ANAZ ZALEELO\nYou are the Almighty and I am the humble.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلرَّفِيعُ وَأَنَا ٱلْوَضِيعُ\nWA ANTAR RAFEE-O’ WA ANAL WAZEE-O’\nYou are the Elevated and I am the meek.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْمُدَبِّرُ وَا نَا ٱلْمُدَبَّرُ\nWA ANTAL MODABBERO WA ANAL MODABBARO\nYou are the Manager and I am managed.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْبَاقِي وَأَنَا ٱلْفَانِي\nWA ANTAL BAAQEE WA ANAL FAANEE\nYou are the Eternal and I am mortal.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلدَّيَّانُ وَأَنَا ٱلْمُدَانُ\nWA ANTAD DAYYAANO WA ANAL MODAANO\nYou are the Judge and I am judged.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْبَاعِثُ وَأَنَا ٱلْمَبْعُوثُ\nWA ANTAL BAA-E’SO WA ANAL MAB-O’OSO\nYou are the Resurrector and I am resurrected.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْغَنِيُّ وَأَنَا ٱلْفَقِيرُ\nWA ANTAL GHANIYYO WA ANAL FAQEERO\nYou are the Rich and I am the poor.\nوَأَنْتَ ٱلْحَيُّ وَأَنَا ٱلْمَيِّتُ\nWA ANTAL HAYYO WA ANAL MAYYETO\nYou are the Ever-living and I am subjected to death.\nتَجِدُ مَنْ تُعَذِّبُ يَا رَبِّ غَيْرِي\nTAJEDO MAN TO-A’ZZEBO YAA RABBE GHAYREE\nYou, O my Lord, can find someone to torment other than me\nوَلاَ أَجِدُ مَنْ يَرْحَمُنِي غَيْرُكَ\nWA LAA AJEDO MAN-Y YARHAMONEE GHAYROKA\nbut I cannot find anyone to have mercy on me other than You.\nاَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَقَرِّبْ فَرَجَهُمْ\nWA QARRIB FARAJAHUM\nhasten their Relief,\nوَٱرْحَمْ ذُلِّي بَيْنَ يَدَيْكَ\nWAR HAM ZULLEE BAYNA YADAYKA\nand have mercy on my humiliation before You,\nوَتَضَرُّعِي إِلَيْكَ\nWA TAZARRO-E’E ELAYKA\nmy imploration to You,\nوَوَحْشَتِي مِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ\nWA WAHSHATEE MENAN NAASE\nmy disassociation from people,\nوَأُنْسِي بِكَ يَا كَرِيمُ\nWA UNSEE BEKA YAA KAREEMO\nand my intimacy with You, O All-generous.\nثُمَّ تَصَدَّقْ عَلَيَّ فِي هٰذِهِ ٱلسَّاعَةِ\nSUMMA TASADDAQ A’LAYYA FEE HAAZEHIS SAA-A’TE\nThen, (please) endue me at this very hour\nبِرَحْمَةٍ مِنْ عِنْدِكَ تُهَدِّئُ بِهَا قَلْبِي\nBE-RAHMATIM MIN I’NDEKA TOHADDE-O BEHAA QALBEE\nwith mercy from You by which You tranquilize my heart,\nوَتَجْمَعُ بِهَا أَمْرِي\nWA TAJMA-O’ BEHAA AMREE\nbring together my affairs,\nوَتَلُمُّ بِهَا شَعَثِي\nWA TALUMMO BEHAA SHA-A’SEE\nreunite my scattering,\nوَتُبَيِّضُ بِهَا وَجْهِي\nWA TOBAYYEZO BEHAA WAJHEE\nwhiten my face,\nوَتُكْرِمُ بِهَا مَقَامِي\nWA TUKREMO BEHAA MAQAAMEE\nconfer honor on my status,\nوَتَحُطُّ بِهَا عَنِّي وِزْرِي\nWA TAHUTTO BEHAA A’NNEE WIZREE\nrelieve me from my burdens,\nوَتَغْفِرُ بِهَا مَا مَضَىٰ مِنْ ذُنُوبِي\nWA TAGHFERO BEHAA MAA MAZAA MIN ZONOOBEE\nforgive my past sins,\nوَتَعْصِمُنِي فِي مَا بَقِيَ مِنْ عُمْرِي\nWA TA’SEMONEE FEE MAA BAQEYA MIN U’MREE\nprotect me against sinning in the rest of my lifetime,\nوَتَسْتَعْمِلُنِي فِي ذٰلِكَ كُلِّهِ\nWA TASTA’MELONEE FEE ZAALEKA KULLEHI\nemploy me in my entire lifetime\nبِطَاعَتِكَ وَمَا يُرْضِيكَ عَنِّي\nBE-TAA-A’TEKA WA MAA YURZEEKA A’NNEE\nin acts of obedience to You and acts that bring about Your pleasure,\nوَتَخْتِمُ عَمَلِي بِأَحْسَنِهِ\nWA TAKHTEMO A’MALEE BE-AHSANEHI\nseal my deeds with the best of them,\nوَتَجْعَلُ لِي ثَوَابَهُ ٱلْجَنَّةَ\nWA TAJ-A’LO LEE SAWAABAHUL JANNATA\ndecide Paradise to be my reward for that,\nوَتَسْلُكُ بِي سَبِيلَ ٱلصَّالِحِينَ\nWA TASLOKO BEE SABEELAS SAALEHEENA\nlead me to the path of the righteous,\nوَتُعِينُنِي عَلَىٰ صَالِحِ مَا أَعْطَيْتَنِي\nWA TO-E’ENONEE A’LAA SAALEHE MAA A-A’TAYTANEE\nhelp me do well with the virtuous of what You have given me\nكَمَا أَعَنْتَ ٱلصَّالِحِينَ عَلَىٰ صَالِحِ مَا أَعْطَيْتَهُمْ\nKAMAA A-A’NTAS SAALEHEENA A’LAA SAALEHE MAA A-A’TAYTAHUM\nin the same way as You have helped the righteous ones do well with what You have given them,\nوَلاَ تَنْزَعْ مِنِّي صَالِحاً أَعْطَيْتِنِيهِ أَبَداً\nWA LAA TANZA’ MINNEE SAALEHAN A-A’TAYTENEEHE ABADAN\nnever deprive me of any virtuous thing that You have given me,\nوَلاَ تَرُدَّنِي فِي سُوءٍ ٱسْتَنْقَذْتَنِي مِنْهُ أَبَداً\nWA LAA TARUDDANEE FEE SOO-ENIS TANQAZTANEE MINHO ABADAN\nnever send me back to a wicked matter from which You have saved me,\nوَلاَ تُشْمِتْ بِي عَدُوّاً وَلاَ حَاسِداً أَبَداً\nWA LAA TUSHMIT BEE A’DUWWANW WA LAA HAASEDAN ABADAN\nnever make my enemy or one who envies me gloat at my misfortune,\nوَلاَ تَكِلْنِي إِلَىٰ نَفْسِي طَرْفَةَ عَيْنٍ أَبَداً\nWA LAA TAKILNEE ELAA NAFSEE TARFATA A’YNIN ABADAN\nand never leave me alone with my own affairs even for a winking of an eye\nوَلاَ أَقَلَّ مِنْ ذٰلِكَ وَلاَ أَكْثَرَ\nWA LAA AQALLA MIN ZAALEKA WA LAA AKSARA\nor less or more than that.\nيَا رَبَّ ٱلْعَالَمِينَ\nYAA RABBAL A’ALAMEENA\nO Lord of the worlds!\nاَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَأَرِنِي ٱلْحَقَّ حَقّاً فَأَتَّبِعَهُ\nWA ARENIL HAQQA HAQQAN FA-ATTABE-A’HU\nshow the right as it is in reality so that I will follow it\nوَٱلْبَاطِلَ بَاطِلاً فَأَجْتَنِبَهُ\nWAL BAATELA BAATELAN FA-AJTANEBAHU\nand the wrong as it is in reality so that I will shun it,\nوَلاَ تَجْعَلْهُ عَلَيَّ مُتَشَابِهاً\nWA LAA TAJ-A’LHO A’LAYYA MOTASHAABEHAN\nnever confuse the right and the wrong for me;\nفَأَتَّبِعَ هَوَايَ بِغَيْرِ هُدىًٰ مِنْكَ\nFA-ATTABE-A’ HAWAAYA BE-GHAYRE HODAM MINKA\nlest I will follow my own desires without finding true guidance from You.\nوَٱجْعَلْ هَوَايَ تَبَعاً لِطَاعَتِكَ\nWAJ A’L HAWAAYA TABA-A’L LE-TAA-A’TEKA\nAnd (please) cause all my desires to follow the obedience to You,\nوَخُذْ رِضَا نَفْسِكَ مِنْ نَفْسِي\nWA KHUZ REZAA NAFSEKA MIN NAFSEE\ntake the pleasure of You from the pleasure of myself,\nوَٱهْدِنِي لِمَا ٱخْتُلِفَ فِيهِ مِنَ ٱلْحَقِّ بِإِذْنِكَ\nWAH DENEE LEMAKH TOLEFA FEEHE MENAL HAQQE BE-IZNEKA\nand guide me to the right about which disagreement has taken place by permission of You;\nإِنَّكَ تَهْدِي مَنْ تَشَاءُ إِلَىٰ صِرَاطٍ مُسْتَقِيمٍ\nINNAKA TAHDEE MAN TASHAAA-O ELAA SERAATIM MUSTAQEEMIN\nverily, You guide whomever You wish to a straight path.\nYou may then pray to Almighty Allah for your personal requests and they shall be granted, Allah willing."
